{"sym":"VLTSA.PA","v":2,"about":{"summary":"Voltalia SA engages in the production and sale of energy generated by the wind, solar, hydropower, biomass, and storage plants. The company operates through two segments, Energy Sales, and Services. It offers development, operations, and maintenance services to renewable energy projects, including equipment procurement and construction. As of December 31, 2024, the company operated solar power plant with an installed capacity of 126 MW. It operates in Africa, the Middle East, Asia, other Europe, Brazil, and Latin America. The company was incorporated in 2005 and is headquartered in Paris, France. Voltalia SA operates as a subsidiary of Voltalia Investissement SA.","lead":"Voltalia SA engages in the production and sale of energy generated by the wind, solar, hydropower, biomass, and storage plants. The company operates through two segments, Energy Sales, and Services.","web":"https://www.voltalia.com","emp":1900,"city":"Paris","country":"France"},"officers":[{"n":"Mr. Robert Klein","t":"Chief Executive Officer","pay":738580,"fy":2025},{"n":"Benoit Kuciel","t":"Chief of Staff & Strategy","pay":52631,"fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Sylvine Bouan","t":"Chief Financial Officer","fy":2025},{"n":"Antoine Merlin","t":"Head of Project Finance","fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Loan Duong","t":"Head of Communications, Marketing & Investor Relations","fy":2025},{"n":"Frédéric Delaffond","t":"Head of Legal & Compliance","fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Celine Blachere","t":"Head of Human Resources & Support Functions","fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Alexis Goybet","t":"Head of Europe","fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Marie-Odile Lavenant","t":"Head of Internal Audit","age":59,"yb":1966,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Yoni Ammar","t":"Deputy CEO & Head of Europe, Latin America, Africa and International Regions","fy":2025}],"gov":{"audit":5,"board":4,"comp":10,"rights":9,"overall":7,"d":"2026-10-01"},"own":{"ins":76.32,"inst":10.15,"inst_float":42.85,"inst_n":50},"funds":[{"n":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguar